From: Liuqin Linux Kit contributors
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: group Liuqin OEM panel commands

Preserve the exact ROM command grouping flags, including the 240-byte
broadcast flush threshold confirmed in OS2.0.6.0.VMYCNXM msm_drm.ko.
An optional ordered host operation avoids shared queued state between
calls; validate before transmit, serialize both hosts, and never replay
errors.
Known Liuqin panels opt in. Legacy single-packet helpers, PPS, power,
reset, touch firmware, brightness and 120ms guard waits are unchanged.

